  ( λ s
    . s
      (λk. k "nat_fold_filtered_branch_in_context")
      (λx_0 x_1 x_2. x_0 λ. nat_fold x_1 x_2)
      (λx_0 x_1 x_2. (x_0 λ. nat_fold_filtered x_1 x_2 + x_0 λ. nat_fold x_1 x_2)) λ_ md _. md λk. k "[nat_fold_filtered_branch_in_context](docs/design/gezi-set-equations-proofs.md)"
  # The typed branch of a structural recursion: the filtered recursion is
